# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository and on checkout,
# regardless of which OS/editor touches them. This avoids CRLF/LF
# diff noise between Bart's Windows checkout and any LF-based tooling.
#
# After adding this file, run once: git add --renormalize .
# then review and commit the (whitespace-only) result separately.
* text=auto eol=lf
